 "response": {
  "text": "If you’re buying **women’s kurta sets online in India**, I’d shortlist these brands rather than choosing purely by price:\n\n| Brand | Best for | Typical feel |\n|---|---|---|\n| **BIBA** | Everyday + versatile | Reliable, polished, lots of cotton/prints |\n| **W for Woman** | Office + smart dressing | More structured and contemporary |\n| **Aurelia** | Office + semi-festive | Trendy, polished, good variety |\n| **Libas** | Budget + trendy | Lots of styles, generally good value |\n| **Fabindia** | Elegant, timeless cotton | Artisanal, understated |\n| **Nayam/Lakshita** | Comfortable everyday wear | Soft, relaxed, easy silhouettes |\n| **Soch** | Festive/occasion wear | More traditional and embellished |\n\n\nA recent 2026 comparison found **W** strongest for polished office wear, **BIBA** particularly practical for everyday cotton sets, **Fabindia** for timeless handcrafted-looking pieces, and **Aurelia** for dressier occasions. [www.hindustantimes.com](https://www.hindustantimes.com/lifestyle/fashion/i-tried-kurta-sets-from-w-fabindia-aurelia-biba-and-lakshita-here-s-which-ones-actually-feel-worth-the-money-101778651587378-amp.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### My top 3\n\n**1. BIBA — safest overall choice**  \nIf you want 3–5 sets that you'll actually wear repeatedly, I'd start here. Their current collection has a particularly broad range of cotton printed, straight, Anarkali and embroidered sets. [www.biba.in](https://www.biba.in/kurta-sets/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### [Biba Women's Embroidered Kurta Set]()\n*₹2,759*\n\n**2. Libas — best value for money**  \nGreat if you want something more fashion-forward without spending too much. Current options include embroidered sets around ₹1,700–₹1,900.\n\n### [Libas Floral Embroidered Straight Suit Set]()\n*₹1,749*\n\n### [Libas Pink Embroidered Straight Suit Set with Dupatta]()\n*₹1,879*\n\n### [Libas Black Floral Georgette Suit Set]()\n*₹2,519*\n\n**3. Aurelia — best for looking polished**  \nI'd choose Aurelia when you want something that works for office, dinners, pujas or small family functions rather than purely casual wear.\n\n### [Aurelia Printed Regular Fit Kurta Set]()\n*₹2,299*\n\n### [Aurelia Printed Straight Kurta Set]()\n*₹3,599*\n\n### [Aurelia Floral Embroidered A-line Set]()\n*₹3,599*\n\n**If you tell me your budget — e.g. ₹1,000, ₹1,500, ₹2,500 or ₹5,000 per set — and whether you want them for office, daily wear, or festive wear, I can narrow it down to the best 5–10 sets currently available online.**",
